    "updated_at": "2016-03-20T17:09:55Z",
    "body": "I updated bikeshed, but... I get a warning for `{{Event/Event()/eventInitDict!!argument}}`. I'd be happy to replace that with `<var>eventInitDict</var>` though, seems better.\n\nHowever, also, CSSOM-VIEW suddenly gets a cousin CSSOM-VIEW-1 reference entry. That's less okay. Couldn't quite figure out why that was happening. Maybe a specref thing, @tobie?\n",
