    "created_at": "2016-03-21T20:33:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-21T20:33:31Z",
    "body": "Yeah, argument autolink handling is being a little bit broken right now (specifically, when you use a `for` value without arguments in the method signature). I'm fixing it as part of generally refactoring autolinking, so feel free to either ignore it or switch it to a plain `<var>` or something.\n\nWill look into the duplicate CSSOM-VIEW stuff. More communication over on the Bikeshed bug.\n",
